Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:53:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] CR-0051 review: a new user message cancels a pending
 memory review
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A review already waiting for 20 s of quiet only restarted its timer on a new
message, so a slow intake turn let it fire mid-turn and read "Switch to dark
mode" before its kind (setting) was known. A new user message now cancels
the pending review; the next reply or finished job starts the 20 s again
(08-3 §12.4 Trigger, X-209). Test for the slow-turn case added.

Fidelity-CR: CR-0051

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SpTENvw4MG6dxxgmAXJYFG
